Recommends: kwalletmanager
Description: Raye account on the desktop
 Sign in to a Raye account from Settings. Your settings follow you to every
 PC you sign in to, along with your picture, your name and your apps.
 Raye works the same without an account.

Package: qml6-module-org-raye-account
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: QML module for the Raye account
 The RayeAccount singleton that Settings and the Store use to talk to the
 Raye account service.
